usly shown role before the empty check. That only belongs on capacity-limited free users, and it has to happen **before** the page slice — not after.\n\nAfter you sign in, I will confirm it on your session (page 5 empty, `/api/board` still advertising ~10 pages), then fix pagination so hide-empty is applied to the visible stream before offset/limit."}]}}
